flowchart TD
    A[Sort ships by arrival then ship id] --> B[Offer per ship: quote seats or allocatable seats or zero]
    B --> C[Record item steps and model step]
    C --> D{Demand positive and some offer positive}
    D -->|no| E[Status empty and nothing chosen]
    D -->|yes| F[Branch and bound over whole offers with capacity equal to demand]
    F --> G{Solver proved optimal}
    G -->|yes| H[Status optimal]
    G -->|no| I[Status feasible and set kept]
    H --> J[Chosen ships ranked first then the rest]
    I --> J
    E --> J
    J --> K[Record solver pick skip and result steps]
